{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "f4f5e6072e1c03b0fcdc5aada606258e1ec91bda61fa52b81743be1c674f6c50", "ja": "裂 ～Rive～", "zh": "裂 ～Rive～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8edfd22cdd13a4a4adf8bec413f64696c17017deaf04b4827688f2b788b8c88a", "ja": "プロデューサーとジュリアがレッスンの様子\nを見に行くと、そこには静香を慰める星梨花\nの姿が。千早は別々にやりたいと、出て行っ\nてしまったらしい。落ち込む静香に、ジュリ\nアは質問を投げかけるのだった。", "zh": "制作人与茱莉亚去查看课程情况时，看到的是正在安慰静香的星梨花。千早似乎说想分开进行，就离开了。面对消沉的静香，朱莉亚向她提出了一个问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bf78a3440d2b3f8bc7a66a8988e309b5d4bb50ff1187380fb49b9c80002e2202", "ja": "（公演に向けてのレッスンが始まった。\n初日だけど、みんなの様子は……）", "zh": "（面向公演的排练开始了。虽然是第一天，不过大家的情况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "c4e8cd56ce2d62c5c2d1b706b015c1af895e72e951711fc0943dbc43b062ce40", "ja": "よっ、{$P$}！　公演準備は順調か？", "zh": "哟，{$P$}！演出准备得顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0f4853996d91cc6b1df524ed51fb88b00e24ea013e209e79b6150c4d563e5974", "ja": "ああ、ほとんどこれからだけど、順調だよ。\nその様子だと、ジュリアも調子良さそうだな。", "zh": "嗯，基本上还没正式开始，不过进展很顺利。\n看你的样子，茱莉亚状态也不错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "3f6005ddfdca8b06ac36b8fb382505fa595033e3b49c867729a9032ecdf0a943", "ja": "ま、今度の公演は、あたしもかなり楽しみだからさ。\nいろんな意味でな♪", "zh": "嘛，下次的公演，我也相当期待啊。\n方方面面都是♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "a2fe48245e1a026b50b58760f0ccfdc306d93db3c579c9035e01f2ad57ddf451", "ja": "でも、シズはあたしの3倍くらい元気そうだぜ！\n今日も朝から絶好調って感じだったし♪", "zh": "不过，静香看起来可比我有精神3倍左右啊！今天早上开始就一直是状态绝佳的感觉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "79ab59ec6145a921f821e1c40512ff5683388a49bcacbde997047c007846b146", "ja": "へえ、なんだか目に浮かぶな……。\n早速、様子を見に行かないと！", "zh": "哦，感觉都能想象出来了……。得赶紧去看看她的情况！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "9cdbd60bcf3ad83c50c2677de0f2b1a39bfaad0f4f25df86f2022220c77ce3e9", "ja": "はぁ…………。", "zh": "唉…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ba0d32783394d7c6c7fd3c775991b00cfc789dcb9922bde0016d57418a3325ca", "ja": "（あれ？）", "zh": "（咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "06ffc4f898ee434566198403dd235275a000e8fc6bb7b4860a87111ef7c5776a", "ja": "あっ、あの……静香さん。\n元気を出してくださいね……？", "zh": "啊，那个……静香姐姐。\n请打起精神来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "a1732f260a4046fb4a29e57bd210f4f213860d4bdc07c661a74100f8e3316fbc", "ja": "うん……ありがとう、星梨花。\n私は、全然大丈夫……。はぁ。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你，星梨花。\n我完全没事……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "69e73c93feb8bc3357bfe199edb5bf1f5f05a5b8ae58db181f8e114c258ce43b", "ja": "お、おいおい、どうしたんだ？\nなんか、朝とずいぶん違うっつーか……？", "zh": "喂、喂喂，你这是怎么了？\n总觉得和早上大不一样，或者说……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e4bfeae62dc49eb5bfb5c28de0681d9de7031bbfa463b24b6f7f4be594334404", "ja": "むしろ絶不調みたいだな……。\n静香、本当にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "反倒像是状态糟透了……。\n静香，你到底是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca3959d5e655fb6fc2e46f318578ee129855c2fcd92df4ddf42ec4297e34d7a2", "ja": "{$P$}、ジュリアさん……。\nべ、別にどうもしません。全然、大丈夫です……。", "zh": "{$P$}、茱莉亚小姐……。\n没、没什么。我完全没事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "acbad7e964b26195e99ca867cfc526e46db7497527af7f7d0a645b81cd1e947d", "ja": "いや全然大丈夫じゃなさそうだけど……ん？\nあれ、チハは？　まだ来てないのか？", "zh": "看起来完全不像没事的样子……嗯？\n咦，千早呢？还没来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "fb66ab59d10bc0b8475274121a6f3f526602cb503c4ccf7d772188f4c30d0278", "ja": "あ、あの……。\n千早さんなんですけど……。", "zh": "啊、那个……  \n关于千早小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "3fbd34b5745cd5fbf0e35ededd70f713240567b54c04042e1cbd10f3380b1a8a", "ja": "千早さん、今日からよろしくお願いします！\nあの、私……頑張りますっ！", "zh": "千早小姐，今后请多多指教！\n那个，我……会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "034d635c32da278d42df41562f7cdfa687f81ef54d7aad26aa3842f950c3faf2", "ja": "あ、それで、スポーツドリンク作りすぎちゃって……\nあの、ノドが乾いたらいくらでも言ってくださいね！", "zh": "啊，对了，我运动饮料做得有点多了……\n那个，要是口渴了，请尽管跟我说哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "353cfe2c57fab2b486c8b7d5ecb03b900bc963b45600a7bd8040ab1adbecf709", "ja": "え、ええ……ありがとう、静香。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……谢谢你，静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "d1dc9b89d006842b780c2254b87176288824b8f0389a07c50d0573d5c1f431ec", "ja": "それじゃあ……とりあえず、通しで歌ってみますか？\n私、ずっと楽しみで……あっ、でも発声練習しなきゃ！", "zh": "那么……总之，要不要先从头到尾唱一遍？\n我一直都很期待……啊，不过得先练习发声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "dd91e1be2ca76772ea82f2c00ad5125d312cc80b89c5cf8d6e8a13f838e2137c", "ja": "ええと……あのね、静香。\nその事だけど……ごめんなさい。", "zh": "那个……静香。\n关于那件事……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "de79e3fb2a1f28112a789325dc0a14ea2f7f0b54f61579b853a44a41f5da5d46", "ja": "私達、最初は別々でレッスンしても……\nいいかしら。", "zh": "我们一开始分开练习……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "e288ac06df9f486bdefe749aa31a69938eae5e1c6ad7e3ff72ab78f6cfce8853", "ja": "えっ。別々……え？", "zh": "诶？分开……诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "3be3d050355910326a75d7ff6942a95eaec613a93a1c3770f1db209228a7caee", "ja": "合わせるのは、ちゃんと身についてからにしたいの。\nまずは、しっかり……向き合いたくて。", "zh": "我想等彻底掌握了之后，再进行合练。\n首先，我想先好好……面对它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "6ad0d75d1f5760d6094274155cee1dbcddc7767288f8ac09bd00c257838de659", "ja": "じつはもう、外のスタジオも借りてあって。\n準備運動も終わったから、この後は、そこで。", "zh": "其实我已经租好了外面的练习室。\n热身也做完了，接下来就去那里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "145e907dfd19e85006df617ad4fc7f43f25cfd06e4c787529d281080c6155911", "ja": "は……はい……わかりました……。", "zh": "好……好的……我明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d1e1bd0f88f350c36c9869fa2fea58f618beb63615efbd6652f3acb292d02984", "ja": "……で、千早はそのまま行っちゃったのか。\nなるほど……。", "zh": "……然后，千早直接就走了啊。\n原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "9fa87669046bf83521b8a89a751218c91d152b6528b8f1c60aee17b6e177c17b", "ja": "はあ。なんつーか、チハらしいけど……。\nそりゃシズも落ち込むよな？", "zh": "唉，该说真不愧是千早吗……  \n静香肯定也会消沉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc834e7c87e478cd4c62d787cc11107ac991540a4457fb6f871be6e132c1961e", "ja": "別に、落ち込んでなんか……いません。はあ。", "zh": "也没有消沉什么的……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "d24d9e877e27076e6d5d52f9a1f012fda4244995c85b1743b9c2c6afba9e206e", "ja": "千早さん、後で合わせるって言ってましたよ？\nだから、あの……頑張りましょう、静香さん！", "zh": "千早说过之后会一起合练的吧？\n所以，那个……我们一起加油吧，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "1557c1dcb8fe82f12362b5a3324ee8d463c3565dce34bd97d36b84a59608ae20", "ja": "う、うん……ありがとう、星梨花。\n……はあ。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……谢谢你，星梨花。\n……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "851337b4bd963bea2ee5e372b3c474dd2d86c537bb60105b41b51604c940b2e7", "ja": "スタジオのことは、後でフォローするか……。\nよし、状況はわかった。でも、そういうことなら……。", "zh": "摄影棚那边的事，之后再想办法补救吧……\n好，我明白情况了。不过，既然这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "522b7257009bd79538d7dce31bf5cc444bd35d7ec85be6a371018182eca1fdd0", "ja": "そうだな。それならそれで、\n落ち込んでても仕方ない。元気出せって、シズ！", "zh": "是啊。既然这样，\n再消沉下去也没用。振作起来，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "b304d13ccdb82be81a216a8c13c40c5216c15b0031ae986417dfdf2e1b8fb729", "ja": "ひとりになって、歌と向き合う。\nそういう時間は、シズにも必要だろ？", "zh": "独自一人面对歌声。\n这样的时间，对静香来说也是必要的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "5583092aa3de88cc94a067c0774fba327f3e0ccf01414f5a26a003516b419066", "ja": "わ、わかってます。わかってますけど、私……\n私は、ただ……！", "zh": "我、我明白的。虽然我明白，但我……\n我只是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
