{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "6da5dc0c447e2a125cc2263395a7a4ac1b8dcae84db4470fa960318be2a5b405", "ja": "楽しみ、ね。……シズ？　それ本当か？", "zh": "很期待，对吧。……静？这是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "760367a75fe673ee137e274eb30bf4201d041dc0a6bd2c62298aa9359e19f09e", "ja": "え？　な、なんですか、それ……。\n本当に決まってるじゃないですか。", "zh": "诶？那、那是什么……。\n当然是真的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_02_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "0e65b6ab7d5fa8794ae0e3405a8c9dc838fb026fce9141ea2cb00e5c6fab5b89", "ja": "なら、いいんだけど。でもさ……。", "zh": "那就好。不过啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
